    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "### Problem\n\nThe functional test for encrypted ZIP archive password handling hangs indefinitely on a clean `master` checkout.\n\nThe test:\n`nvim.zip prompts for the password of an encrypted archive`\n\ndoes not complete when running the ZIP functional test suite. The functional test process eventually times out.\n\nThe same is also true for the test `nvim.zip reports an incorrect archive password`  which just follows `nvim.zip prompts for the password of an encrypted archive` in the same test file. \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Check out a clean `master` checkout.\n2. Build Neovim.\n3. Run:\n\n   `make functionaltest TEST_FILE=test/functional/plugin/zip_spec.lua`\n\n4. The test suite reaches:\n\n   `RUN T23 nvim.zip prompts for the password of an encrypted archive:`\n\n5. The test does not complete and eventually terminates due to the functional-test timeout.\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nThe test should complete successfully.\n\n### Nvim version (nvim -v)\n\nNVIM v0.13.0-dev-1364+g 9bd18d04f1\nBuild type: Debug\nLuaJIT 2.1.1785763465\n\n### Vim (not Nvim) behaves the same?\n\nN/A\n\n### Operating system/version\n\nEndeavourOS\n\n### Terminal name/version\n\nkitty 0.48.2 created by Kovid Goyal\n\n### $TERM environment variable\n\nxterm-kitty\n\n### Installation\n\nbuild from repo",
